OL,3,GNEWSASecond Labour MP suspended over
OL,4,ACovid loan repayments
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second Labour MP, Perran Moon, has
OL,7,Fbeen suspended over Covid loan
OL,8,Frepayments, after voluntarily referring
OL,9,Fhimself for investigation.
OL,11,FMoon, the MP for Camborne and Redruth,
OL,12,Fis listed on Companies House as the
OL,13,Fco-director of a training company
OL,14,Fcalled Autoswot, which last filed
OL,15,Faccounts in June 2021.
OL,17,FGovernment Bounce Back Loans of up to
OL,18,F#50,000 were made available to support
OL,19,Fsmall businesses during the pandemic,
OL,20,Fbut a government report found the
OL,21,Fscheme was vulnerable to fraud and
OL,22,Ferror.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
