OL,3,GNEWSASecond Labour MP suspended over
OL,4,ACovid loan repayments
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn August, Labour MP Bayo Alaba was
OL,7,Fsuspended after queries about a
OL,8,FCovid-era loan, and a third MP, James
OL,9,FMcMurdock, quit Reform in 2025 after
OL,10,Fquestions about eligibility for loans
OL,11,Fhe received.
